    "fallback_markdown": "A comprehensive report on the Mercedes-Benz S-Class features, incorporating data from various sources. The report includes an executive summary, market landscape overview, feature analysis, model comparisons, safety analysis, technology and innovation, comfort and convenience, performance metrics, exterior design elements, competitive analysis, risk factors, hidden signals, source citations, and final recommendations.",
    "reasoning": "Used all_globals_schema fields and tool outputs to generate a comprehensive report with 15+ sections detailing the features of the Mercedes-Benz S-Class. The report includes an executive summary, market landscape, detailed feature analysis, model comparisons, safety analysis, technology and innovation, comfort and convenience, performance metrics, exterior design, competitive analysis, risk factors, hidden signals, source citations, and final recommendations.",
    "mercedes_s_class_features_markdown_T003": "<div class='report'>\n  <h1>\ud83d\udcca Mercedes-Benz S-Class Comprehensive Analysis Report</h1>\n\n  <div class='executive-summary'>\n    <h2>\ud83c\udfaf Executive Summary</h2>\n    <p>\nThe Mercedes-Benz S-Class stands as a paragon of luxury sedans, celebrated for its relentless innovation and unparalleled passenger comfort. This report delves into the myriad features that define the S-Class, drawing insights from a variety of sources to provide a comprehensive understanding of its offerings.\n    </p>\n    <p>\n      Key features include the advanced MBUX system, a suite of sophisticated safety technologies, and a range of powerful engine options. The S-Class epitomizes automotive excellence, setting a high benchmark for luxury and technology.\n    </p>\n\n    <h3>Key Highlights:</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Advanced MBUX System: A cutting-edge infotainment system with a large OLED touchscreen and voice recognition.</li>\n      <li>Comprehensive Safety Suite: Front and rear cabin airbags, along with advanced driver assistance systems.</li>\n      <li>Diverse Model Range: Including S 500 4MATIC, S 580e 4MATIC (hybrid), and S 580 4MATIC.</li>\n      <li>Engine Variety: Options ranging from a 6-cylinder turbo to a V8 twin-turbo.</li>\n      <li>Luxurious Comforts: Leather seats, dual power front seats, and premium audio.</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <h2>\ud83d\udd0d Market Landscape Overview</h2>\n  <p>\nThe Mercedes-Benz S-Class operates within the luxury sedan market, competing with other high-end vehicles that offer similar levels of comfort, technology, and performance. Key competitors include the BMW 7 Series, Audi A8, and Lexus LS. The S-Class has consistently maintained a strong market position due to its reputation for innovation and quality.\n  </p>\n\n  <h2>\ud83d\udcb0 Feature Analysis</h2>\n  <p>\nThe Mercedes-Benz S-Class is equipped with a multitude of features designed to enhance the driving experience and passenger comfort. These features can be broadly categorized into technology, safety, comfort, and performance.\n  </p>\n\n  <h3>Technology Features:</h3>\n  <ul>\n    <li>MBUX System: Advanced infotainment system with voice recognition.</li>\n    <li>Bluetooth Connectivity: Seamless smartphone integration.</li>\n    <li>Smartphone Interface: Compatibility with Apple CarPlay and Android Auto.</li>\n    <li>Internet Access: Provides in-car internet connectivity.</li>\n    <li>Navigation System: Advanced navigation for precise route guidance.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h3>Safety Features:</h3>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Front and Rear Cabin Airbags: Comprehensive occupant protection.</li>\n    <li>Driver Assistance Systems: Includes adaptive cruise control, lane keeping assist, and blind-spot monitoring.</li>\n    <li>Collision Warning System: Alerts the driver to potential collisions.</li>\n    <li>Driver Attention Assist: Monitors driver alertness and provides warnings.</li>\n    <li>Child Safety Features: Child seat anchors and child door locks.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h3>Comfort and Convenience Features:</h3>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Leather Seats: Premium leather upholstery for enhanced comfort.</li>\n    <li>Dual Power Front Seats: Adjustable front seats with memory function.</li>\n    <li>Leather-Wrapped Steering Wheel: Provides a luxurious feel.</li>\n    <li>Remote Keyless Entry: Convenient vehicle access.</li>\n    <li>Remote Engine Start: Start the engine remotely for pre-heating or cooling.</li>\n    <li>Premium Audio System: High-quality sound system for an immersive audio experience.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h3>Performance Features:</h3>\n  <ul>\n    <li>Engine Options: Range from 6-cylinder turbo to V8 twin-turbo.</li>\n    <li>4MATIC All-Wheel Drive: Enhanced traction and stability.</li>\n    <li>0-60 mph Acceleration: Ranges from 4.3 to 4.9 seconds depending on the model.</li>\n    <li>Top Speed: Limited to 130 mph.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2>\ud83d\ude97 Model Comparison</h2>\n  <p>\nThe Mercedes-Benz S-Class is available in several models, each offering a unique combination of features and performance. A comparison of the main models is provided below:\n  </p>\n\n  <table>\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th>Model</th>\n        <th>Engine</th>\n        <th>Horsepower</th>\n        <th>Torque</th>\n        <th>0-60 mph</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <td>S 500 4MATIC</td>\n        <td>6-Cyl, MHEV, Turbo, 3.0 Liter</td>\n        <td>442 HP</td>\n        <td>413 lb-ft</td>\n        <td>4.9 seconds</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>S 580e 4MATIC (Hybrid)</td>\n        <td>6-Cyl, Hybrid, Turbo, 3.0 Liter</td>\n        <td>510 HP</td>\n        <td>694 lb-ft</td>\n        <td>4.5 seconds</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>S 580 4MATIC</td>\n        <td>V8, MHEV, Twin Turbo, 4.0 Liter</td>\n        <td>496 HP</td>\n        <td>516 lb-ft</td>\n        <td>4.3 seconds</td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n\n  <h2>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Safety Analysis</h2>\n  <p>\nThe S-Class places a high emphasis on safety, incorporating a range of features designed to protect occupants and prevent accidents. Key safety features include:\n  </p>\n  <ul>\n    <li><b>Comprehensive Airbag System:</b> Includes front and rear cabin airbags, providing all-around protection in the event of a collision.</li>\n    <li><b>Advanced Driver Assistance Systems (ADAS):</b> Features such as adaptive cruise control, lane keeping assist, and blind-spot monitoring enhance driver awareness and prevent accidents.</li>\n    <li><b>Collision Warning System:</b> Detects potential collisions and alerts the driver, providing additional time to react.</li>\n    <li><b>Driver Attention Assist:</b> Monitors the driver's level of alertness and provides warnings if drowsiness or inattentiveness is detected.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2>\ud83d\udca1 Technology and Innovation</h2>\n  <p>\nThe S-Class is at the forefront of automotive technology, featuring innovations that enhance the driving experience and passenger comfort. Highlights include:\n  </p>\n  <ul>\n    <li><b>MBUX (Mercedes-Benz User Experience):</b> A cutting-edge infotainment system that integrates voice control, touchscreen interface, and personalized settings to provide a seamless and intuitive user experience.</li>\n    <li><b>Augmented Reality Navigation:</b> Projects navigation instructions onto the windshield, providing clear and precise guidance.</li>\n    <li><b>Advanced Lighting Systems:</b> Adaptive headlights and intelligent lighting systems optimize visibility in various driving conditions.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2>\ud83d\udcba Comfort and Convenience</h2>\n  <p>\nThe S-Class offers a luxurious and comfortable interior, designed to provide a premium experience for both driver and passengers. Key comfort and convenience features include:\n  </p>\n  <ul>\n    <li><b>Premium Seating:</b> Leather seats with multi-contour adjustments and massage functions provide optimal support and relaxation.</li>\n    <li><b>Climate Control:</b> Multi-zone climate control system ensures that all occupants can enjoy their preferred temperature settings.</li>\n    <li><b>Ambient Lighting:</b> Customizable ambient lighting creates a relaxing and sophisticated atmosphere inside the cabin.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2>\ud83c\udfce\ufe0f Performance Metrics</h2>\n  <p>\nThe performance of the S-Class is characterized by its powerful engine options, smooth handling, and responsive acceleration. Key performance metrics include:\n  </p>\n  <ul>\n    <li><b>Engine Options:</b> A range of engine choices, from the efficient 6-cylinder turbo to the powerful V8 twin-turbo, allows drivers to select the level of performance that best suits their needs.</li>\n    <li><b>Acceleration:</b> The S-Class delivers quick acceleration, with 0-60 mph times ranging from 4.3 to 4.9 seconds, depending on the model.</li>\n    <li><b>Handling:</b> Adaptive suspension and precise steering prov